# Deal data lives in Postgres now (DATABASE_URL), not a local file, so
# there's normally nothing here to ignore - but a local SQLite file used as
# input to scripts/migrate-sqlite-to-postgres.js (a copy of the pre-Postgres
# database) should also never be committed. WAL mode creates -wal/-shm
# sidecar files alongside the main db file.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
